//Closed Medical Center
"ClosedHospital" "This plaque is dedicated to all of the doctors and nurses who worked tirelessly amid the Rikti invasion to give their patients the best possible care, even as their own lives were put at risk."

//Hero Among Ruins
"KarnKronos" "Karn Kronos was one of the first Heroes on the scene when the Rikti mothership slammed into the city of White Plains.  He spent hours amid the flames and debris pulling trapped citizens from the rubble.  Interestingly, though he had no special force field powers or resistances to fire, he never received a mark."

//First Strike
"TheFirst" "This building, Huwe Enterprises, a non-profit organization and personal crusade of Preston Huwe, was the first building destroyed in the Rikti Invasion.  Preston, away on philanthropic business in Africa at the time, was unharmed and moved his operation to Atlas Park."

